  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "總體經濟學(二)",
    "sub_ename": "MACROECONOMICS(2)",
    "describe_ch": "涵蓋一些較深入的總體核心經濟問題，可作為學生進階研習總體經濟學的基礎。課程中將介紹公共債務的動態演化、施行反通膨政策的困境、開放經濟下的分析模型、國際經濟與金融及長期經濟成長等相關問題，並讓學生理解各種相容或相斥的研究方法及模型，進而教導學生認知總體經濟思想的多樣性。此外，總體經濟問題的重要實證發現或計量應用也將在合宜的主題導入教學。修本門課學生必須在研究小組中貢獻其心力完成一篇學期報告。訓練學生具有批判式的學習與理解及特定總體經濟問題的解析能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course covers core issues in macroeconomics at an advanced level that may serve as a basis for further study in macroeconomics.  The course will focus on the dynamics of public debt, the dilemma of conducting anti-inflation policies, analytical models for open economy, and the issues of international trade and finance, and long term growth, etc.  These topics give students an understanding of many different approaches that both complement and compete with each other.  This also leads to an understanding of the diversity of macroeconomic thinking.  Additionally, empirical and econometric content will be included where feasible.  One of student responsibilities in this course is to contribute your research effort in a term paper that is completed by the team work of a research group. The overall goal is to gain a broad and critical understanding of models that can help to analyze specific macroeconomic issues.",
    "pre_subname": "ECON1001經濟學(一)、ECON1002經濟學(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "ECON1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "ECON1001 ECONOMICS(1)、ECON1002 ECONOMICS(2)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解經濟政策的效果及其種種限制",
      "describe_en": "Understand the effects and the limitations of various macroeconomic policies."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能理解各經濟學派的主張與爭論",
      "describe_en": "Understand the various philosophy of macroeconomics"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "理解經濟成長與資源的關",
      "describe_en": "Capture the relationship between economic growth and resourses."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能分析開放經濟下更複雜的總體經濟問題",
      "describe_en": "Enable to analyze the various economic issues under the framework of open economy."
    }
  ],
